load @term/seed/code/structure/space/vector
  find vector-space

# A phase space: the space of all states of a mechanical system, each point fixing both the positions and the momenta,
# so the system's future is a single trajectory through it. Its natural geometry is symplectic, the antisymmetric
# pairing of position against momentum. The form carries the underlying vector space; the symplectic pairing is the
# added structure.
form phase-space
  link space, like vector-space
